    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d976">

                <pb facs="0757" n="675" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg675"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister on Special
                        Mission.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-06-13"><hi rendition="#italic">June 13,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of the joint note dated the 10th instant, signed by yourself and Mr. Calvo,
                    minister of Costa Rica, inclosing a joint note addressed by you and Mr. Calvo to
                    the honorable the Chief Justice of the United States of America, in which the
                    latter is requested to accept the office of arbitrator of the boundary dispute
                    between the Republics of Panama and Costa Rica.</p>
                <p>In reply I have the honor to inform you that I have taken pleasure in forwarding
                    to the Chief Justice, this day, the letter which you and Mr. Calvo have
                    addressed to him, with the copy of the convention which accompanied it.</p>
                <p>A note similar to this has also been addressed to Mr. Calvo.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">P. C. Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
